WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:04.300
(suspenseful music)

00:00:17.588 --> 00:00:19.620
- I grew up in Newport Beach, California,

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:21.895
where for those of you
who've seen the housewives

00:00:21.895 --> 00:00:24.578
or watched The O.C. it is a place with

00:00:24.578 --> 00:00:26.787
a lot of beautiful people,
a lot of affluence.

00:00:26.787 --> 00:00:30.417
Growing up, I felt the
expectation of me was

00:00:30.417 --> 00:00:32.845
to be a success by getting married

00:00:32.845 --> 00:00:34.305
and having really cute babies.

00:00:34.305 --> 00:00:36.404
And that was my number one job.

00:00:36.404 --> 00:00:38.783
At 24, I did exactly that, got engaged.

00:00:38.783 --> 00:00:42.713
It took me a while to really understand

00:00:42.713 --> 00:00:45.389
and navigate that I could
go against the grain

00:00:45.389 --> 00:00:47.056
on that expectation.

00:00:47.056 --> 00:00:48.864
Ended up calling my
wedding two weeks before,

00:00:48.864 --> 00:00:51.334
realized it wasn't the right path for me.

00:00:51.334 --> 00:00:53.130
Fast forward ten years, I still

00:00:53.130 --> 00:00:54.831
haven't met the right person.

00:00:54.831 --> 00:00:56.710
I've been excited about my career,

00:00:56.710 --> 00:00:58.532
excited about traveling, dating,

00:00:58.532 --> 00:01:01.016
doing all sorts of things
that somebody in their 30s

00:01:01.016 --> 00:01:05.281
is not expected to want to
still do all these things.

00:01:05.281 --> 00:01:07.368
I never thought I would be somebody

00:01:07.368 --> 00:01:09.073
who would be interested
in freezing my eggs,

00:01:09.073 --> 00:01:11.422
and then my dad passed away unexpectedly,

00:01:11.422 --> 00:01:13.470
and that changed everything.

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:16.468
It made me realize how
important family is,

00:01:16.468 --> 00:01:20.052
and although today I may
not see myself having kids

00:01:20.052 --> 00:01:23.719
in this moment, maybe
I'll want that later.

00:01:23.719 --> 00:01:25.894
I would love to keep my options open.

00:01:25.894 --> 00:01:27.505
When I went to the doctor's office

00:01:27.505 --> 00:01:29.513
for just an informational visit,

00:01:29.513 --> 00:01:31.957
just to learn, you know, little
bit more about the process,

00:01:31.957 --> 00:01:33.662
they ran some preliminary tests

00:01:33.662 --> 00:01:35.481
and I had just started my period,

00:01:35.481 --> 00:01:39.036
which is the ideal time to
start the hormone theory

00:01:39.036 --> 00:01:42.581
and start this process,
so with the test results,

00:01:42.581 --> 00:01:44.883
provided those were okay, which they were,

00:01:44.883 --> 00:01:48.295
they wanted to go ahead and
start my hormone therapy

00:01:48.295 --> 00:01:49.484
if I was on board.

00:01:49.484 --> 00:01:51.403
I was actually a little
bit more excited about it

00:01:51.403 --> 00:01:52.845
than I thought that I would be,

00:01:52.845 --> 00:01:55.884
and through the tests, we
did my first ultrasound.

00:01:55.884 --> 00:01:58.060
He showed me, these are your ovaries,

00:01:58.060 --> 00:01:59.927
this is where the baby would grow,

00:01:59.927 --> 00:02:02.586
and it was the first
time in my entire life

00:02:02.586 --> 00:02:06.120
that I felt any kind of
ping of maternal stuff.

00:02:06.120 --> 00:02:10.220
It just so happened to
be that now is the time

00:02:10.220 --> 00:02:12.742
and my body was ready, why not?

00:02:12.742 --> 00:02:14.572
So when I started this process,

00:02:14.572 --> 00:02:17.822
I had an entire table full of hormones.

00:02:18.671 --> 00:02:21.145
The purpose of the hormone injections

00:02:21.145 --> 00:02:25.324
is to basically, it's like
steroids for your eggs.

00:02:25.324 --> 00:02:27.797
As a natural woman, you
drop one egg a month,

00:02:27.797 --> 00:02:30.617
but because of these hormones,
you have tons of them.

00:02:30.617 --> 00:02:32.748
And then you want them to
get big and fat and juicy

00:02:32.748 --> 00:02:35.176
so that they can see them
when they're going in

00:02:35.176 --> 00:02:36.759
to harvest the egg.

00:02:50.976 --> 00:02:53.531
Then it's the last 30 hours when they say,

00:02:53.531 --> 00:02:54.765
"Okay, now you're ready to go."

00:02:54.765 --> 00:02:56.292
That's when you get the trigger shot,

00:02:56.292 --> 00:02:58.468
and that was pretty intense.

00:02:58.468 --> 00:03:01.292
So pull down the pants,
look in the mirror,

00:03:01.292 --> 00:03:04.445
and they teach you, you have
to inject yourself so hard

00:03:04.445 --> 00:03:07.142
that it goes behind the
muscle and they tell you

00:03:07.142 --> 00:03:09.694
as you check it, if there's blood,

00:03:09.694 --> 00:03:11.608
that it's not far enough so you have to

00:03:11.608 --> 00:03:13.918
push it out and do it again, so thank God

00:03:13.918 --> 00:03:15.632
I got it on the first try.

00:03:15.632 --> 00:03:18.956
So the trigger shot then
will start the process

00:03:18.956 --> 00:03:21.218
of getting the follicles ready

00:03:21.218 --> 00:03:23.225
and the eggs ready for retrieval.

00:03:23.225 --> 00:03:25.687
30 hours later, show up
at the doctor's office.

00:03:25.687 --> 00:03:29.461
They put me to sleep,
they go up inside me,

00:03:29.461 --> 00:03:31.252
and they, you know, broke the follicles

00:03:31.252 --> 00:03:34.781
to suction out the eggs and the
eggs are immediately frozen.

00:03:34.781 --> 00:03:36.319
The process itself is very quick.

00:03:36.319 --> 00:03:38.706
The procedure took maybe 20 minutes.

00:03:38.706 --> 00:03:42.291
The doctor predicted that
I would have 12 to 14 eggs

00:03:42.291 --> 00:03:44.932
at the end of this process
that they could harvest.

00:03:44.932 --> 00:03:48.396
Out of those eggs, they
say one out of every four,

00:03:48.396 --> 00:03:50.315
count on those being viable.

00:03:50.315 --> 00:03:52.838
I ended up having 20 eggs, which was

00:03:52.838 --> 00:03:54.581
a lot more than they expected.

00:03:54.581 --> 00:03:57.183
And about 48 hours after the surgery,

00:03:57.183 --> 00:03:59.955
I immediately just puffed out.

00:03:59.955 --> 00:04:02.695
With the 20 follicles
that my body had created,

00:04:02.695 --> 00:04:05.630
as the doctor goes in
there to retrieve the eggs,

00:04:05.630 --> 00:04:07.770
they basically puncture each follicle

00:04:07.770 --> 00:04:10.240
and then suck out this
little microscopic egg.

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:13.145
Well, all that fluid around that egg

00:04:13.145 --> 00:04:14.727
now has to go somewhere.

00:04:14.727 --> 00:04:17.114
It was the most frustrating time ever,

00:04:17.114 --> 00:04:20.561
being a woman that has
curves and has always

00:04:20.561 --> 00:04:23.973
been conscious of what am I
eating and am I exercising

00:04:23.973 --> 00:04:25.895
and am I losing weight,
am I gaining weight,

00:04:25.895 --> 00:04:28.711
I was put in a position
where my body was constantly

00:04:28.711 --> 00:04:31.321
gaining weight even
though I wasn't eating,

00:04:31.321 --> 00:04:34.092
I wasn't drinking, I
couldn't even have water,

00:04:34.092 --> 00:04:35.501
and yet I'm gaining weight.

00:04:35.501 --> 00:04:38.668
It sucked, it was absolutely terrible.

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:44.890
For some people, freezing
your eggs might be easy,

00:04:44.890 --> 00:04:47.574
lickity-split, no problem,
I'm back to work the next day.

00:04:47.574 --> 00:04:49.579
For me personally, it was not that.

00:04:49.579 --> 00:04:51.918
Everybody is unique, their
situations are unique,

00:04:51.918 --> 00:04:54.096
but I think it's important
to know all sides

00:04:54.096 --> 00:04:55.942
so you can make an educated decision

00:04:55.942 --> 00:04:58.232
based on all perspectives.

00:04:58.232 --> 00:05:00.852
When I grew up, I never
felt I could be respected

00:05:00.852 --> 00:05:03.322
for wanting to be the
person that I truly am.

00:05:03.322 --> 00:05:06.298
So whatever you choose,
let it be your choice.

00:05:06.298 --> 00:05:10.107
What's right for you, not
what the expectations were

00:05:10.107 --> 00:05:12.821
of you growing up, or what
your parents want you to do,

00:05:12.821 --> 00:05:14.910
what your boyfriend wants
you to do, your husband.

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:16.332
It's you, you have to have

00:05:16.332 --> 00:05:19.332
the best relationship with yourself.

